#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><title>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:250
#, xml-text
msgid "About Commented Out Packages"
msgstr "Acerca de Pacotes Comentados"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:252
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In the above list, several files are commented out with a hash (#) "
"character."
msgstr ""
"Na lista acima, vários arquivos estão comentados com um caractere cerquilha "
"(#)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:257
#, xml-text
msgid "The plasma-sdk package is optional and used for software development."
msgstr ""
"O pacote plasma-sdk é opcional e usado para desenvolvimento de software."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:262
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The discover package requires <xref linkend=\"appstream\"/> to be built with"
" the -D qt=true switch."
msgstr ""
"O pacote de descoberta exige que <xref linkend=\"appstream\"/> seja "
"construído com a chave -D qt=true."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:268
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The breeze-grub, breeze-plymouth, and plymouth-kcm packages above are all "
"for customized support of <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/Plymouth/\"> "
"Plymouth</ulink> which is designed to be run within an initial ram disk "
"during boot (see <xref linkend=\"initramfs\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Os pacotes breeze-grub, breeze-plymouth e plymouth-kcm acima são todos para "
"suporte personalizado do <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/Plymouth/\"> "
"Plymouth</ulink>, que foi projetado para ser executado dentro de um disco "
"inicial RAM durante a inicialização (veja-se <xref linkend=\"initramfs\"/>)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:277
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The plasma-browser-integration package is designed to implement browser "
"integration for Plasma into Mozilla Firefox and Google Chrome. The package "
"does build, but is only useful if you want these browsers to be integrated "
"into the shell in a way that lets you see (and control) downloads from "
"Plasma's notifications area, as well as allowing you to search browser "
"history in the KDE Runner. Note that you must also install a browser "
"extension for this to work. For more details, see <ulink "
"url=\"https://community.kde.org/Plasma/Browser_Integration\"> the KDE Plasma"
" wiki page about browser integration.</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"O pacote plasma-browser-integration foi projetado para implementar "
"integração do navegador para Plasma no Mozilla Firefox e no Google Chrome. O"
" pacote constrói, mas só é útil se você quiser que esses navegadores sejam "
"integrados ao shell de uma forma que permita que você veja (e controle) "
"downloads originários da área de notificações do Plasma, bem como que você "
"pesquise o histórico do navegador no KDE Runner. Observe que você também "
"precisa instalar uma extensão do navegador para isso funcionar. Para mais "
"detalhes, veja-se <ulink "
"url=\"https://community.kde.org/Plasma/Browser_Integration\"> a página wiki "
"do KDE Plasma acerca de integração do navegador</ulink>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:291
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The krdp package is used to allow an RDP server to be run while using "
"Plasma. This feature requires the 2.x version of FreeRDP, which is not in "
"BLFS."
msgstr ""
"O pacote krdp é usado para permitir que um servidor RDP seja executado "
"enquanto usar Plasma. Esse recurso exige a versão 2.x do FreeRDP, que não "
"está no BLFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:298
#, xml-text
msgid "The plasma-nano package is used for embedded systems."
msgstr "O pacote plasma-nano é usado para sistemas embarcados."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:303
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The plasma-mobile, plasma-dialer, and spacebar packages provide phone "
"functionality for Plasma."
msgstr ""
"Os pacotes plasma-mobile, plasma-dialer e spacebar fornecem funcionalidade "
"de telefone para o Plasma."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:309
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The flatpak-kcm package is for managing support of flatpak applications."
msgstr ""
"O pacote flatpak-kcm é para suporte de gerenciamento de aplicativos flatpak."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:314
#, xml-text
msgid "The kwayland-integration application requires plasma5 support."
msgstr "O aplicativo kwayland-integration exige suporte plasma5."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:319
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The plasma-login-manager application provides a display manager for KDE "
"Plasma, forked from SDDM and with an new frontend providing a greeter, "
"wallpaper plugin integration and System Settings module (KCM)."
msgstr ""
"A aplicação plasma-login-manager fornece um gerenciador de exibição para KDE"
" Plasma, bifurcado a partir do SDDM e com uma nova estrutura de interação "
"direta com o(a) usuário(a) que fornece um saudador, integração de plugin de "
"papel de parede e módulo de configurações do sistema (KCM)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:331
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Plasma"
msgstr "Instalação do Plasma"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:336
#, xml-text
msgid "First, start a subshell that will exit on error:"
msgstr "Primeiro, inicie um sub shell que sairá em caso de erro:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:339
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>bash -e</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>bash -e</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:342
#, xml-text
msgid "Install all of the packages by running the following commands:"
msgstr "Instale todos os pacotes executando os seguintes comandos:"

#.  some packages end up with files owned by root in $packagedir,
#.      so use as_root for removing
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:346
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>while read -r line; do\n"
"\n"
"    # Get the file name, ignoring comments and blank lines\n"
"    if $(echo $line | grep -E -q '^ *$|^#' ); then continue; fi\n"
"    file=$(echo $line | cut -d\" \" -f2)\n"
"\n"
"    pkg=$(       echo $file|sed 's|^.*/||')    # Remove directory\n"
"    name=$(      echo $pkg |sed 's|-6.*$||')   # Isolate package name\n"
"    packagedir=$(echo $pkg |sed 's|\\.tar.*||') # Source directory\n"
"\n"
"    tar -xf $file\n"
"    pushd $packagedir\n"
"\n"
"       mkdir build\n"
"       cd    build\n"
"\n"
"       cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=$KF6_PREFIX \\\n"
"             -D CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBEXECDIR=libexec \\\n"
"             -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release         \\\n"
"             -D BUILD_QT5=OFF                    \\\n"
"             -D BUILD_TESTING=OFF                \\\n"
"             -W no-dev ..  &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"        make\n"
"        as_root make install\n"
"    popd\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"    as_root rm -rf $packagedir\n"
"    as_root /sbin/ldconfig\n"
"\n"
"done &lt; plasma-&plasma-version;.md5\n"
"\n"
"exit</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>while read -r line; do\n"
"\n"
"    # Get the file name, ignoring comments and blank lines\n"
"    if $(echo $line | grep -E -q '^ *$|^#' ); then continue; fi\n"
"    file=$(echo $line | cut -d\" \" -f2)\n"
"\n"
"    pkg=$(       echo $file|sed 's|^.*/||')    # Remove directory\n"
"    name=$(      echo $pkg |sed 's|-6.*$||')   # Isolate package name\n"
"    packagedir=$(echo $pkg |sed 's|\\.tar.*||') # Source directory\n"
"\n"
"    tar -xf $file\n"
"    pushd $packagedir\n"
"\n"
"       mkdir build\n"
"       cd    build\n"
"\n"
"       cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=$KF6_PREFIX \\\n"
"             -D CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBEXECDIR=libexec \\\n"
"             -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release         \\\n"
"             -D BUILD_QT5=OFF                    \\\n"
"             -D BUILD_TESTING=OFF                \\\n"
"             -W no-dev ..  &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"        make\n"
"        as_root make install\n"
"    popd\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"    as_root rm -rf $packagedir\n"
"    as_root /sbin/ldconfig\n"
"\n"
"done &lt; plasma-&plasma-version;.md5\n"
"\n"
"exit</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:383
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you did not set <envar>$KF6_PREFIX</envar> to <filename>/usr</filename>, "
"create symlinks to allow display managers to find "
"<application>Plasma</application>, and to allow the XDG Desktop Portal to be"
" detected. As the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você não configurou <envar>$KF5_PREFIX</envar> como "
"<filename>/usr</filename>, crie links simbólicos para permitir que "
"gerenciadores de tela encontrem o <application>Plasma</application> e para "
"permitir que XDG Desktop Portal seja detectado. Como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#.  work around a bug in xdg-desktop-portal
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:389
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput># Setup xsessions (X11 sessions)\n"
"install -dvm 755 /usr/share/xsessions\n"
"cd /usr/share/xsessions\n"
"\n"
"[ -e plasma.desktop ] ||\n"
"ln -sfv $KF6_PREFIX/share/xsessions/plasmax11.desktop \n"
"\n"
"# Setup wayland-sessions \n"
"install -dvm 755 /usr/share/wayland-sessions\n"
"cd /usr/share/wayland-sessions\n"
"\n"
"[ -e plasmawayland.desktop ] ||\n"
"ln -sfv $KF6_PREFIX/share/wayland-sessions/plasma.desktop\n"
"\n"
"# Setup xdg-desktop-portal\n"
"install -dvm 755 /usr/share/xdg-desktop-portal\n"
"cd /usr/share/xdg-desktop-portal \n"
"\n"
"[ -e kde-portals.conf ] ||\n"
"ln -sfv $KF6_PREFIX/share/xdg-desktop-portal/kde-portals.conf\n"
"\n"
"# Setup kde portal\n"
"install -dvm 755 /usr/share/xdg-desktop-portal/portals\n"
"cd /usr/share/xdg-desktop-portal/portals\n"
"\n"
"[ -e kde.portal ] ||\n"
"ln -sfv $KF6_PREFIX/share/xdg-desktop-portal/portals/kde.portal</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput># Setup xsessions (X11 sessions)\n"
"install -dvm 755 /usr/share/xsessions\n"
"cd /usr/share/xsessions\n"
"\n"
"[ -e plasma.desktop ] ||\n"
"ln -sfv $KF6_PREFIX/share/xsessions/plasmax11.desktop \n"
"\n"
"# Setup wayland-sessions \n"
"install -dvm 755 /usr/share/wayland-sessions\n"
"cd /usr/share/wayland-sessions\n"
"\n"
"[ -e plasmawayland.desktop ] ||\n"
"ln -sfv $KF6_PREFIX/share/wayland-sessions/plasma.desktop\n"
"\n"
"# Setup xdg-desktop-portal\n"
"install -dvm 755 /usr/share/xdg-desktop-portal\n"
"cd /usr/share/xdg-desktop-portal \n"
"\n"
"[ -e kde-portals.conf ] ||\n"
"ln -sfv $KF6_PREFIX/share/xdg-desktop-portal/kde-portals.conf\n"
"\n"
"# Setup kde portal\n"
"install -dvm 755 /usr/share/xdg-desktop-portal/portals\n"
"cd /usr/share/xdg-desktop-portal/portals\n"
"\n"
"[ -e kde.portal ] ||\n"
"ln -sfv $KF6_PREFIX/share/xdg-desktop-portal/portals/kde.portal</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:418
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Useless systemd units have been installed in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">$KF6_PREFIX/lib</filename>. Remove them now (as "
